{"meta":{"nbResults":77},"repertoires":{"5933":{"id":5933,"title":"Tedi i magiczna lampa ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tedi-i-magiczna-lampa-2026-09-26-11-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787211697.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T11:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":166,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 11:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-20 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 11:00:00"},"products":[{"id":308,"name":"Kanapa","rawPrice":5000,"price":"50,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":11},{"id":309,"name":"Bilet N","rawPrice":2500,"price":"25,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":155}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":435,"name":"Tedi i magiczna lampa ","description":"Oli, nieustraszona dwuletnia c\u00f3rka Tadeo, sprawi\u0142a, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 on nadopieku\u0144czym ojcem, a urocza Mumia czuje si\u0119 odsuni\u0119ta na bok. Kiedy w Pa\u0142acu Buckingham znajduj\u0105 magiczn\u0105 lamp\u0119, Mumia prosi j\u0105 o przeniesienie w czasie do Paititi w Peru w 1502 roku. Tad, Sara i ca\u0142a ekipa b\u0119d\u0105 musieli pod\u0105\u017cy\u0107 za Mumi\u0105 w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107, zanim co\u015b zmieni bieg historii\u2026 Podr\u00f3\u017c zabierze ich przez Ocean Atlantycki z Peru do Grecji, a stamt\u0105d w g\u0142\u0105b Bliskiego Wschodu, a\u017c do jaskini Ali Baby i czterdziestu rozb\u00f3jnik\u00f3w","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787211697.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":4,"name":"Kino kawiarnia Goleni\u00f3w","institution_name":"","location_description":"arabskie oznaczenia rz\u0119d\u00f3w","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Goleni\u00f3w","city_id":715,"zip":"72-100","addresse":"Konstytucji 3-go Maja 16"}},"5934":{"id":593